OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely dry day with rather a
OL,6,Flot of cloud but also some bright
OL,7,Fintervals. A few brief showers will
OL,8,Fpass through on the light
OL,9,Fnorthwesterly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA mostly dry start to the
OL,12,Fevening with a little brightness.
OL,13,FOtherwise, staying cloudy with
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain or drizzle.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FA rather cloudy day but some
OL,17,Fbright intervals breaking through at
OL,18,Ftimes. There will also be the odd
OL,19,Fpassing light shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
