OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA dry
OL,6,Fperiod is expected with variable
OL,7,Famounts of cloud but some sunny spells
OL,8,Fat times. Southeasterly winds
OL,9,Fstrengthening on Wednesday.
